# The owner's chest touch-ups (asset_odyssey::body_morph), one per line:
#
#   <appearance.2da label prefix> <amount>
#
# A body drawn for an appearance.2da row whose label starts so (any case),
# or a body model only such rows name, has its chest drawn larger by
# <amount> at the centre of each side (0.7: 70%), easing to nothing at the
# edge. The models are untouched. `#` to the end of a line is a comment.

# Bastila's rows: her own, cutscene and slave ones.
party_npc_bastila 0.7
